    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Lip slightly tight; no pain, drooling, or trouble eating</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest tightness, palpitations, or leg swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No muscle aches on atorvastatin</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>Lip sensation normal</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

